G-PF-DECORATORS (PF-B4) — @personality tools the model CALLS to durably self-modify (mood/voice/
traits/self-fact), through the existing @skill + run_with_tools loop. (2026-07-03)
=========================================================================================
Fourth brick of CONTRACT-PERSONALITY. PF-B3 gave a tag SHORTCUT; PF-B4 gives a first-class, DURABLE
action: the model INVOKES @personality tools via the same tool_code protocol used for every skill.
`@personality` is just `@skill(pack="personality")`, so advertise/parse/dispatch is 100% reused.

BUILD (harness harness/personality/tools.py, this-commit):
  * personality() = skill(pack="personality", category="system") — the decorator.
  * adjust_mood(mood) / set_voice(voice) / set_trait(trait, action=add|remove) — write the PF-B2
    persona state (parse_persona -> update -> write_state); return a confirmation string.
  * remember_self(fact) — record a self-model fact (PF-B1). All resolve SP_PERSONA_FILE /
    SP_SELF_MODEL_ROOT so they compose.
  * self_model.py: added _resolve_root (explicit arg > SP_SELF_MODEL_ROOT env > default) so every
    self-model caller (incl. the remember_self tool) honours the env root (bug found by the gate).

GATE G-PF-DECORATORS (no LLM — the tool-call loop itself is already proven for @skill):
  registered personality pack = [adjust_mood, remember_self, set_trait, set_voice]; each has a valid
  OpenAI function schema (run_with_tools would advertise them); set_trait's schema exposes {trait, action}.
  calling them (as the model would): adjust_mood("focused") · set_voice("terse") · set_trait("bold",add)
  · set_trait("formal",remove) · remember_self("I can classify my own memories.") ->
    persona state = {voice: terse, mood: focused, traits: curious, bold}  (formal removed, curious kept)
    self-model gained the fact.
  RESULT pf-decorators: PASS (personality pack registered w/ schemas + model-callable + durable self-modify + self-fact)

VERDICT: GREEN. PF-B4 done — the model has a first-class, model-callable API to change its own
mood/voice/traits and record self-facts, riding the exact @skill + run_with_tools machinery.
Activation on the live agent = advertise the "personality" pack (gated SP_PERSONALITY, like PF-B3).

